      "text": "I'll call the third meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:16:48.090",
      "end": "00:16:50.690",
      "text": "of the Corporate Services Committee tour."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:16:50.690",
      "end": "00:16:53.530",
      "text": "It's one o'clock right now."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:16:53.530",
      "end": "00:16:56.500",
      "text": "Please check the city website for additional meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:16:56.500",
      "end": "00:16:57.560",
      "text": "detail information."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:16:57.560",
      "end": "00:16:59.220",
      "text": "Meetings can be viewed via live stream"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:16:59.220",
      "end": "00:17:01.910",
      "text": "on YouTube and the city website."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:17:01.910",
      "end": "00:17:04.150",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:17:04.150",
      "end": "00:17:09.740",
      "text": "of the Anishabeg, Haudenosaunee, Lenna Pawak,"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:17:09.740",
      "end": "00:17:11.100",
      "text": "and the Anawandran."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:17:11.100",
      "end": "00:17:13.220",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history of languages"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:17:13.220",
      "end": "00:17:15.070",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:17:15.070",
      "end": "00:17:17.050",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:17:17.050",
      "end": "00:17:18.220",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:17:18.220",
      "end": "00:17:21.240",
      "text": "to many First Nations, M\u00e9tis, and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:17:21.240",
      "end": "00:17:23.360",
      "text": "As representatives of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:17:23.360",
      "end": "00:17:24.650",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:17:24.650",
      "end": "00:17:27.690",
      "text": "to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:17:27.690",
      "end": "00:17:30.180",
      "text": "The city of London is committed to making every effort,"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:17:30.180",
      "end": "00:17:32.890",
      "text": "provide alternative formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:17:32.890",
      "end": "00:17:35.390",
      "text": "for meeting meetings on a quest."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:17:35.390",
      "end": "00:17:37.820",
      "text": "To making a quest specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:17:37.820",
      "end": "00:17:42.780",
      "text": "please contact csc@london.ca or 519-661-2489 extension-2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:17:42.780",
      "end": "00:17:49.690",
      "text": "We will start with any disclosures"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:17:49.690",
      "end": "00:17:53.890",
      "text": "of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
