    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:19:13.630",
      "end": "00:19:16.940",
      "text": "And both of those did have London addresses attached to them."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:19:16.940",
      "end": "00:19:20.160",
      "text": "So, looking for a motion to have those two proclamations."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:19:20.160",
      "end": "00:19:23.510",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor Stevenson, Councillor Cuddley."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:19:23.510",
      "end": "00:19:29.620",
      "text": "Any discussion on that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:19:29.620",
      "end": "00:19:40.500",
      "text": "Just typing it on one second."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:19:40.500",
      "end": "00:20:02.900",
      "text": "For voting in a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:20:02.900",
      "end": "00:20:03.700",
      "text": "Closing the vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:20:03.700",
      "end": "00:20:07.210",
      "text": "Motion carries, 4-0."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:20:07.210",
      "end": "00:20:08.030",
      "text": "Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:20:08.030",
      "end": "00:20:09.320",
      "text": "We're now on to confidential items."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:20:09.320",
      "end": "00:20:11.840",
      "text": "If I could get a motion to go in camera, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:20:11.840",
      "end": "00:20:13.440",
      "text": "Councillor Cuddy, Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:20:13.440",
      "end": "00:20:17.440",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:20:17.440",
      "end": "00:20:36.170",
      "text": "We'll open that for voting in a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:20:36.170",
      "end": "00:20:47.400",
      "text": "Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:20:47.400",
      "end": "00:20:48.200",
      "text": "Closing the vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:20:48.200",
      "end": "00:23:18.780",
      "text": "Motion carries, 4-0."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:23:18.780",
      "end": "00:23:20.370",
      "text": "Okay, we're back in public session."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:23:20.370",
      "end": "00:23:23.510",
      "text": "Councillor Cuddy, can you please report out?"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:23:23.510",
      "end": "00:23:25.280",
      "text": "Thank you, Chair, and through you,"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:23:25.280",
      "end": "00:23:30.400",
      "text": "we met in a closed session from 1-0-4 to 1-15 PM."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:23:30.400",
      "end": "00:23:33.250",
      "text": "We made progress in the areas that we met,"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:23:33.250",
      "end": "00:23:35.360",
      "text": "which we met in camera."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:23:35.360",
      "end": "00:23:38.000",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:23:38.000",
      "end": "00:23:39.280",
      "text": "Thank you, and we're on our last item."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:23:39.280",
      "end": "00:23:41.480",
      "text": "I'm already adjournment."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:23:41.480",
      "end": "00:23:42.380",
      "text": "Can we get a motion to adjourn?"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:23:42.380",
      "end": "00:23:44.110",
      "text": "Councillor Cuddy, Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:23:44.110",
      "end": "00:23:45.160",
      "text": "Okay, just do a hand vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:23:45.160",
      "end": "00:23:47.600",
      "text": "All those in favor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:23:47.600",
      "end": "00:23:48.760",
      "text": "Put that."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:23:48.760",
      "end": "00:23:49.600",
      "text": "Less than 20 minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:23:49.600",
      "end": "00:23:50.440",
      "text": "Good job, everybody."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:23:50.440",
      "end": "00:23:51.200",
      "text": "Motion passes."
    }
  ],
